      "operator_name": "Reverse/Rearrange",
      "idea": "Reverse the standard filter cleaning mechanism. Design a large-scale, gravity-fed sand filter system where media backwashing is achieved by reversing the water flow using only natural head pressure difference (siphoning/gravity), eliminating the need for expensive, electric backwash pumps, complex controls, and expert maintenance during cleaning cycles.",
      "trace_id": "scamper-R"
    }
  ]
}

