      "idea": "Utilize high-energy plasma generation (like a small, contained xenon flash system) synchronized precisely with the detection of a pedestrian stepping into the crosswalk. The system emits an extremely short, intense, high-visibility light pulse onto the crosswalk surface, creating an aggressive, momentary visual warning that instantly breaks through driver distraction.",
      "trace_id": "triz-38"
    }
  ]
}

